1
00:00:00,959 --> 00:00:02,920
Timer apps have always been missing something.

2
00:00:02,961 --> 00:00:06,924
They're great when something has to happen at a certain time, or

3
00:00:06,965 --> 00:00:08,592
finish in a certain amount of time.

4
00:00:08,634 --> 00:00:10,594
But some things you want to keep going.

5
00:00:12,596 --> 00:00:16,433
Yoga, meditation, prayer, a plank.

6
00:00:16,475 --> 00:00:19,436
You don't want something telling you loudly to stop.

7
00:00:19,436 --> 00:00:22,397
Just a gentle sign that you've done your minimum

8
00:00:22,439 --> 00:00:23,398
for the day.

9
00:00:24,316 --> 00:00:27,277
I'm a father of 6 and an indie developer.

10
00:00:27,277 --> 00:00:30,239
I need at least 15 quiet minutes a day.

11
00:00:32,366 --> 00:00:35,327
And the last thing you want is to stop mid-plank to

12
00:00:35,369 --> 00:00:37,329
tap your watch and silence an alarm.

13
00:00:38,205 --> 00:00:40,165
So I built AtLeast.

14
00:00:41,250 --> 00:00:44,211
AtLeast is a passive timer for Apple Watch.

15
00:00:45,003 --> 00:00:46,964
Gentle taps tell you to keep going.

16
00:00:47,923 --> 00:00:50,717
When the taps stop, you've reached your minimum.

17
00:00:50,842 --> 00:00:51,802
It doesn't interrupt

18
00:00:51,802 --> 00:00:52,719
your flow.

19
00:00:52,719 --> 00:00:53,679
It lets you keep going.

20
00:00:55,013 --> 00:00:55,973
Here's how it works.

21
00:00:58,934 --> 00:00:59,893
Pick your minimum.

22
00:01:02,479 --> 00:01:03,438
Press Start,

23
00:01:03,981 --> 00:01:05,941
and put your wrist down.

24
00:01:07,317 --> 00:01:11,071
Every few seconds, a gentle tap. No countdown.

25
00:01:11,196 --> 00:01:12,447
Nothing to look at.

26
00:01:16,159 --> 00:01:18,120
Keep going as long as you like.

27
00:01:18,120 --> 00:01:22,082
When you're done, you see how far past your minimum you went.

28
00:01:22,124 --> 00:01:24,084
And it's saved to Apple Health.

29
00:01:24,876 --> 00:01:25,836
That's it.

30
00:01:27,004 --> 00:01:28,964
Pick a timer on your iPhone.

31
00:01:29,006 --> 00:01:30,966
And it's waiting on your wrist.

32
00:01:31,008 --> 00:01:31,967
No watch on you?

33
00:01:33,010 --> 00:01:34,970
It runs on your iPhone too.

34
00:01:38,307 --> 00:01:41,268
AtLeast is free, Apple Health included.

35
00:01:41,268 --> 00:01:44,021
AtLeast Pro lets you save your own timers, see

36
00:01:45,022 --> 00:01:45,981
your history and streaks.

37
00:01:46,773 --> 00:01:48,734
And use every session type.

38
00:01:49,776 --> 00:01:51,737
Try it free for 7 days on the annual plan.

39
00:01:51,737 --> 00:01:53,697
AtLeast is on the App Store now.

40
00:01:53,697 --> 00:01:56,658
Go to atleast.app and try it today.

